qUmrNckr7GWUykGufQA3ht.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"At the start of class one day, a first year student comes to see Tensai. After speaking with her, Tensai returns in a bad mood and walks out of the class. The same day, one of the people Juugo met in the Tsukuyomi District, Tetsu, transfers into Third High School.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gU797qUmrNckr7GWUykGufQA3ht.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8864","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20556","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21561","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60832","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"276896","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"30228","synopsis":"Tensai and Daruku have not been seen since meeting with Suruga Aya. Though he's worried about them, Juugo goes out to have fun at Southred Mall with Yumeji, Tetsu, and Yun. Ikusaba Hiiyo has been watching them strengthen their friendships and follows them, while Tsurezure Kagetora follows him.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cKANqK5xpMHQTz4b7qKeNonbFdt.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"Tensai and Daruku have not been seen since meeting with Suruga Aya. Though he's worried about them, Juugo goes out to have fun at Southred Mall with Yumeji, Tetsu, and Yun. Ikusaba Hiiyo has been watching them strengthen their friendships and follows them, while Tsurezure Kagetora follows him.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cKANqK5xpMHQTz4b7qKeNonbFdt.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8864","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10